# Copy to .env and fill in real values. .env is already gitignored (see
# .gitignore) — never commit it.
#
# These are read directly by the gateway process via os.Getenv at
# startup (cmd/gateway/main.go's buildPipeline) — one per configured
# deployment's api_key_env field in config.yaml. The names below match
# gateway/config.example.yaml's two example deployments exactly; add or
# rename entries here to match whatever deployments your own config.yaml
# actually declares.
#
# Everything else gateway reads (config file path, Redis address, budget
# persistence path, guardrail policy version, ...) is YAML config, not
# an environment variable — see docs/operations/DEPLOY.md's
# Configuration Reference section.

OPENAI_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
